<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's TVI to announce Soci/SBS deal - paper.</title>
<headline>Portugal's TVI to announce Soci/SBS deal - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent Portuguese television station TVI will announce an agreement later today with SBS (Scandinavian Broadcasting System) and Portugal's Soci group aimed at solving the station's financial difficulties, the daily Publico reported.</p>
<p>The newspaper said a shareholders' meeting would vote in favour of a deal with Soci/SBS. It did not outline the terms of the agreement.</p>
<p>The shareholders will also vote on a proposal to reduce and then raise the company's share capital.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
